WEBVTT

00:06:59.125 --> 00:07:02.025
and his turmoil and anger
over this pregnancy.

00:07:03.434 --> 00:07:05.034
But he didn't leave.

00:07:05.339 --> 00:07:09.896
She went on to tell me
that they realized now it's OK to cry.

00:07:10.633 --> 00:07:13.974
And he had told her that when he cries,

00:07:13.998 --> 00:07:15.678
he doesn't feel as angry.

00:07:16.876 --> 00:07:18.026
Wow!

00:07:18.487 --> 00:07:21.923
Not only did crying
bring my class together,

00:07:21.947 --> 00:07:23.881
it kept that couple together.

00:07:24.844 --> 00:07:28.362
And you know, his comment about anger
was really, really intriguing to me,

00:07:28.386 --> 00:07:30.683
so I looked around, did some research,